c                                        | IDLE     Typing command...
curl                                     | KNOWN    Downloads from a URL.
curl -fsSL h                             | KNOWN    Downloads "h" and prints it.
curl -fsSL ht                            | KNOWN    Downloads "ht" and prints it.
