curl -fsSL https://get.example.sh        | KNOWN    Downloads "https://get.example.sh" and prints it.
curl -fsSL https://get.example.sh | su   | CAUTION  Switches user. Default is a root shell.
curl -fsSL https://get.example.sh | sud  | KNOWN    Downloads "https://get.example.sh" and prints it.
curl -fsSL https://get.example.sh | sudo | CAUTION  Runs the next command as administrator.
